[25.84169, "o", "\r\n--- ops notes ---\r\n"]
[25.842615, "o", "Relay operations notes\r\n========================\r\n\r\n`/app/bin/crashrail compile` renders `/app/relaydesk/gen/routing_map.py` from\r\n`/app/faultdata/roster.toml`. Tablegen walks the roster twice, so a full compile\r\npass takes about ten seconds on this bench.\r\n\r\nThe switchboard imports that module at route time. When import fails, every\r\nsignature answers as `platform-core` with `source: default` even though compile\r\nexits zero.\r\n\r\nAdjust the codemill tablegen sources so compile emits an importable map, then\r\nrerun compile before routing checks.\r\n"]
[25.842774, "o", "\r\n--- generated bytes/import ---\r\n"]
